# Memory model (per-user + global)

* **Per-user card**: `{name, last_seen, claims[{text, time, verified}], trust_score, likes, dislikes, style_notes}`
* **Place card**: `{plot_id, tags, last_fun_score, hazards, return_cooldown}`
* **Experience snippets**: short, keyword-searchable entries (to enable “remind me why I avoid Corey’s FPS jump maze?”).
* Memory is **evidence-first**: claims become **facts** only when the bot observes corroborating signals (signs, nodes, mini-game triggers, crowd presence).

